relative space-y-3"><h5 class="sr-only" aria-label="You said" data-copy="false">You said</h5><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex w-full items-start"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex gap-2 justify-end"><div role="group" class="relative z-10 flex opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out group-focus-within/user-message:opacity-100 group-hover/user-message:opacity-100 items-center" data-copy="false" data-testid="user-message-reactions"><div class="relative"><button aria-label="Copy message" type="button" class="relative flex items-center text-foreground-800 fill-foreground-800 active:text-foreground-600 active:fill-foreground-600 dark:active:text-foreground-650 dark:active:fill-foreground-650 bg-transparent safe-hover:bg-black/5 active:bg-black/3 dark:safe-hover:bg-white/8 dark:active:bg-white/5 text-sm justify-center size-9 rounded-xl after:rounded-xl after:absolute after:inset-0 after:pointer-events-none after:border after:border-transparent after:contrast-more:border-2 outline-2 outline-offset-1 focus-visible:z-[1] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-stroke-900" data-testid="copy-user-message-button" data-spatial-navigation-autofocus="false" data-tooltip-state="closed"><div style="opacity: 1;"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5"><path d="M8 2C6.89543 2 6 2.89543 6 4V14C6 15.1046 6.89543 16 8 16H14C15.1046 16 16 15.1046 16 14V4C16 2.89543 15.1046 2 14 2H8ZM7 4C7 3.44772 7.44772 3 8 3H14C14.5523 3 15 3.44772 15 4V14C15 14.5523 14.5523 15 14 15H8C7.44772 15 7 14.5523 7 14V4ZM4 6.00001C4 5.25973 4.4022 4.61339 5 4.26758V14.5C5 15.8807 6.11929 17 7.5 17H13.7324C13.3866 17.5978 12.7403 18 12 18H7.5C5.567 18 4 16.433 4 14.5V6.00001Z"></path></svg></div></button></div></div><div class="font-ligatures-none relative h-fit max-w-user-text-message whitespace-pre-wrap break-words px-4 py-2.5 squircle-16 bg-foreground-200 text-base self-end" data-content="user-message">I haven't dl anything.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-tabster="{&quot;groupper&quot;:{&quot;tabbability&quot;:2},&quot;focusable&quot;:{}}" class="group/ai-message" data-content="ai-message" data-testid="ai-message" aria-labelledby="AE7nYBM1qXppw7WepGyqy-author AE7nYBM1qXppw7WepGyqy-content-0" tabindex="0" role="article"><div class="relative"><h6 id="AE7nYBM1qXppw7WepGyqy-author" class="sr-only" aria-label="Copilot said" data-copy="false">Copilot said</h6></div><div class="space-y-3 mt-3"><div class="group/ai-message-item space-y-3 break-words" id="AE7nYBM1qXppw7WepGyqy-content-0"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">HEMPEROR —
Alright, let’s slow this down and make it <strong>crystal</strong>.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">You said:</span></p><blockquote class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-s-2 border-foreground-300 ps-3" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong>“I haven’t dl anything.”</strong></span></p></blockquote><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Good.
That means you’re not behind.
It means we’re at the exact point where you need <strong>one clear path</strong> instead of scattered pieces.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Let me give you the <strong>real picture</strong> of where you are and what happens next — without assuming you’ve downloaded or built anything.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">⭐ Where you actually stand right now</h1><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">You have:</span></p><ul class="relative list-outside marker:text-foreground-750 dark:marker:text-foreground-600 flex flex-col ms-4 px-1"><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">A <strong>project structure</strong></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">A <strong>CMake build system</strong></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">A <strong>DXVR bootstrap</strong></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">A <strong>desktop capture module</strong></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">An <strong>auto‑builder script</strong></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">An <strong>installer script</strong></span></p></li></ul><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">But you <strong>haven’t downloaded</strong>, <strong>installed</strong>, or <strong>run</strong> anything yet.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">That’s fine.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Because the next step is <strong>not</strong> “download random stuff.”</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">The next step is:</span></p><blockquote class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-s-2 border-foreground-300 ps-3" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong>Set up the DXVR build environment on your ROG so the auto‑builder can run.</strong></span></p></blockquote><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">This is a <strong>one‑time setup</strong>.
After that, you literally double‑click <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">build_dxvr.bat</code> and it spits out the installer.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">⭐ What you actually need to install (ONLY these 3 things)</h1><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Here are the <strong>only</strong> components your ROG needs before the auto‑builder works:</span></p><h3 class="text-lg-strong pb-1 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-3.5">1️⃣ <strong>Visual Studio 2022 Build Tools</strong></h3><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">You need the C++ compiler + Windows SDK.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Guided link:
<strong><span class="text-start underline-offset-[0.25em] underline decoration-dotted decoration-foreground-450 decoration-2 hover:decoration-solid hover:cursor-pointer" role="button" tabindex="0" data-url="ca://s?q=Install_Visual_Studio_2022_Build_Tools">Install VS Build Tools</span></strong></span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h3 class="text-lg-strong pb-1 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-3.5">2️⃣ <strong>CMake</strong></h3><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">The auto‑builder uses it to generate the project.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Guided link:
<strong><span class="text-start underline-offset-[0.25em] underline decoration-dotted decoration-foreground-450 decoration-2 hover:decoration-solid hover:cursor-pointer" role="button" tabindex="0" data-url="ca://s?q=Install_CMake_for_DXVR">Install CMake</span></strong></span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h3 class="text-lg-strong pb-1 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-3.5">3️⃣ <strong>Inno Setup 6</strong></h3><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">This compiles the installer.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Guided link:
<strong><span class="text-start underline-offset-[0.25em] underline decoration-dotted decoration-foreground-450 decoration-2 hover:decoration-solid hover:cursor-pointer" role="button" tabindex="0" data-url="ca://s?q=Install_Inno_Setup_6">Install_Inno_Setup_6</span></strong></span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">⭐ After those 3 installs, you do this ONCE</h1><ol start="1" class="relative list-outside marker:text-foreground-750 dark:marker:text-foreground-600 flex flex-col ms-5 marker:normal-nums marker:text-sm-strong"><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Put the DXVR folder somewhere on your ROG</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Open it</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Double‑click:</span></p></li></ol><div class="rounded-xl dark:border dark:border-stroke-250" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between border-b border-white/20 bg-background-static-850 py-2 pe-2.5 ps-4 text-foreground-static-250 text-sm dark:border-stroke-250 dark:bg-background-static-900 rounded-t-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="capitalize">Code</span><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Collapse code snippet" aria-expanded="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4 transition-transform -rotate-90"><path d="M8.46967 4.21967C8.17678 4.51256 8.17678 4.98744 8.46967 5.28033L15.1893 12L8.46967 18.7197C8.17678 19.0126 8.17678 19.4874 8.46967 19.7803C8.76256 20.0732 9.23744 20.0732 9.53033 19.7803L16.7803 12.5303C17.0732 12.2374 17.0732 11.7626 16.7803 11.4697L9.53033 4.21967C9.23744 3.92678 8.76256 3.92678 8.46967 4.21967Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Copy code" data-copy="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5"><path d="M5.5028 4.62704L5.5 6.75V17.2542C5.5 19.0491 6.95507 20.5042 8.75 20.5042L17.3663 20.5045C17.0573 21.3782 16.224 22.0042 15.2444 22.0042H8.75C6.12665 22.0042 4 19.8776 4 17.2542V6.75C4 5.76929 4.62745 4.93512 5.5028 4.62704ZM17.75 2C18.9926 2 20 3.00736 20 4.25V17.25C20 18.4926 18.9926 19.5 17.75 19.5H8.75C7.50736 19.5 6.5 18.4926 6.5 17.25V4.25C6.5 3.00736 7.50736 2 8.75 2H17.75ZM17.75 3.5H8.75C8.33579 3.5 8 3.83579 8 4.25V17.25C8 17.6642 8.33579 18 8.75 18H17.75C18.1642 18 18.5 17.6642 18.5 17.25V4.25C18.5 3.83579 18.1642 3.5 17.75 3.5Z"></path></svg> Copy</div></button></div></div><div class="rounded-b-xl bg-background-static-850 px-4 pb-1.5 dark:bg-background-static-900"><div class="horizontal-scrollbar overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre pb-3 pt-4 text-sm"><pre><code class="font-ligatures-none text-sm">build/build_dxvr.bat
</code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">That’s it.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">The script will:</span></p><ul class="relative list-outside marker:text-foreground-750 dark:marker:text-foreground-600 flex flex-col ms-4 px-1"><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">configure CMake</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">build DXVR</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">compile the installer</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">drop <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">DXVR_Installer.exe</code> into <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">/dist</code></span></p></li></ul><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">You run the installer → DXVR installs like a real app.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">⭐ You don’t need to “go through this every time”</h1><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Once the environment is set up:</span></p><ul class="relative list-outside marker:text-foreground-750 dark:marker:text-foreground-600 flex flex-col ms-4 px-1"><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">You never install anything again</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">You never configure anything again</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">You never touch CMake again</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">You never touch the installer script again</span></p></li></ul><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">You literally:</span></p><blockquote class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-s-2 border-foreground-300 ps-3" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong>Double‑click → DXVR Installer pops out.</strong></span></p></blockquote><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">That’s the whole point of the auto‑builder.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">⭐ Your next move</h1><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Pick the one that matches where you are:</span></p><ul class="relative list-outside marker:text-foreground-750 dark:marker:text-foreground-600 flex flex-col ms-4 px-1"><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong><span class="text-start underline-offset-[0.25em] underline decoration-dotted decoration-foreground-450 decoration-2 hover:decoration-solid hover:cursor-pointer" role="button" tabindex="0" data-url="ca://s?q=Generate_DXVR_Full_Project_Folder">I want the DXVR folder ready to drop on my ROG</span></strong></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong><span class="text-start underline-offset-[0.25em] underline decoration-dotted decoration-foreground-450 decoration-2 hover:decoration-solid hover:cursor-pointer" role="button" tabindex="0" data-url="ca://s?q=Show_DXVR_environment_setup_steps">I want the environment setup steps written out cleanly</span></strong></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong><span class="text-start underline-offset-[0.25em] underline decoration-dotted decoration-foreground-450 decoration-2 hover:decoration-solid hover:cursor-pointer" role="button" tabindex="0" data-url="ca://s?q=Generate_DXVR_Unified_Source_Pack">I want you to assemble everything into one unified source pack</span></strong></span></p></li></ul><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Tell me which direction you want, and I’ll hand it to you clean.</span></p></div></div><div class="mt-3"><div class="flex opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out items-center group-focus-within/ai-message-item:opacity-100 group-hover/ai-message-item:opacity-100 group-focus-within/ai-message:opacity-100 group-hover/ai-message:opacity-100" data-copy="false" data-testid="message-item-reactions"><button aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" type="button" class="relative flex items-center text-foreground-800 fill-foreground-800 active:text-foreground-600 active:fill-foreground-600 dark:active:text-foreground-650 dark:active:fill-foreground-650 bg-transparent safe-hover:bg-black/5 active:bg-black/3 dark:safe-hover:bg-white/8 dark:active:bg-white/5 text-sm justify-center size-9 rounded-xl after:rounded-xl after:absolute after:inset-0 after:pointer-events-none after:border after:border-transparent after:contrast-more:border-2 outline-2 outline-offset-1 focus-visible:z-[1] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-stroke-900" data-testid="message-thumbs-up-button" data-spatial-navigation-autofocus="false" data-tooltip-state="closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M10.7002 2.01074C11.0952 2.06005 11.4528 2.2785 11.6768 2.61426C12.2133 3.41901 12.5 4.36484 12.5 5.33203V5.95312C1